<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 225 0 R
/E (We engineered a unified, normalized relational database that centralizes all placement data. By applying rigorous database normalization \(1NF/2NF/3NF\), we eliminated redundancy and anomalies. Automated business logic through triggers and stored procedures replaces manual intervention. The full-stack architecture \(Vite frontend + Node.js backend + MySQL database\) provides seamless user experience while maintaining data integrity.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
