/E (The system transforms manual placement operations into a fully normalized, automated, and scalable database solution, eliminating redundancy through 1NF, 2NF, and 3NF while significantly improving performance with optimized indexing and queries . It ensures data consistency and reliability using ACID transactions, triggers, and constraints, while views and role-based access control enhance security. By automating workflows and enabling real-time analytics, the system reduces manual effort, supports faster decision-making, and provides a robust, industry-ready solution capable of handling large-scale placement data efficiently.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [2]
>>
